# sidebar-scroll (fix-viewer-size phase 2): a wheel of 300 over the sidebar at
# 1024 x 640. The reference's `overflow: auto` turns the wheel's pixels into
# `scrollTop`, clamped: 300 over 735 of content in 526 of client gives the max,
# 209. The wait lets the engines' overlay scrollbar fade (none shows a
# classic one at rest).
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 216 400
wheel 0 300
wait 1000
shot sidebar-scroll
